OL,3,CLife-saving heart screenings from
OL,4,Cfootball club 'win for patients and
OL,5,CNHS'
OL,7,FITV News' Anna Youssef went to see all
OL,8,Fof the work being done to administer
OL,9,Fblood tests to fans.
OL,11,FA Premier League Football club is
OL,12,Foffering life-saving quick and simple
OL,13,Ffinger-prick blood tests to fans.
OL,15,FThe pioneering screening programme
OL,16,Foffered by Everton in the Community
OL,17,Fallows anyone over 40 to get checked
OL,18,Ffor heart or lung problems.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
