PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1786744260
OL,3,CLife-saving heart screenings from
OL,4,Cfootball club 'win for patients and
OL,5,CNHS'
OL,7,FFor lifelong Toffees fan Ray Catesby,
OL,8,F74, the test has been nothing short of
OL,9,Flife-saving.
OL,11,FRay, who'd been visiting hospital for
OL,12,Fother health issues for two years,
OL,13,Fnoticed a poster at his local art club
OL,14,Fasking, "Are you breathless?"
OL,16,FAlthough he had never been tested for
OL,17,Fbreathlessness during his hospital
OL,18,Fvisits, the question made him think
OL,19,Fand prompted him to get checked.
OL,26,@vD@IOUvD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,363,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1786744260
OL,3,CLife-saving heart screenings from
OL,4,Cfootball club 'win for patients and
OL,5,CNHS'
OL,7,FHe said: "That poster really hit home.
OL,8,FI realised none of my hospital trips
OL,9,Fhad checked for breathlessness.
OL,11,F"If I hadn't got tested, I think I
OL,12,Fwould have become a lot more ill, and
OL,13,Fyou know, I wouldn't be sitting here
OL,14,Fnow."
OL,16,FFollowing the screening, Ray was
OL,17,Fdiagnosed with heart failure and is
OL,18,Fnow on life-saving medication.
OL,20,FHe's urging others to do the same and
OL,21,Fget checked out.
OL,26,@oD@JOUvD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
