OL,3,CLife-saving heart screenings from
OL,4,Cfootball club 'win for patients and
OL,5,CNHS'
OL,7,FFunded by the British Heart
OL,8,FFoundation, the community-based
OL,9,Fservice aims to spot and treat heart
OL,10,For lung problems as quickly as
OL,11,Fpossible, often before serious
OL,12,Fcomplications develop.
OL,14,FResults from the screening are usually
OL,15,Favailable in just 10 minutes.
OL,17,FJames Yates, Health Screening Lead,
OL,18,Fexplained: "A lot of people tell us
OL,19,Fabout the frustrations with waiting
OL,20,Ftimes for appointments and follow-ups.
OL,26,@zD@LOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
