PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1786744260
OL,3,CLife-saving heart screenings from
OL,4,Cfootball club 'win for patients and
OL,5,CNHS'
OL,7,F"If we can offer a short turnaround
OL,8,Ftime between screening, detection,
OL,9,Fdiagnosis, and treatment, it's much
OL,10,Fpreferable for people. They can get on
OL,11,Fwith treatment and have an improved
OL,12,Fquality of life."
OL,14,FSince launching in 2023, the award-
OL,15,Fwinning BEAT Breathlessness initiative
OL,16,Fhas screened over 2,000 people and is
OL,17,Falready making a major impact, not
OL,18,Fjust on lives, but on NHS resources
OL,19,Ftoo.
OL,26,@tD@QO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
