PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1786744260
OL,3,CLife-saving heart screenings from
OL,4,Cfootball club 'win for patients and
OL,5,CNHS'
OL,7,FConsultant cardiologist Dr Rajiv
OL,8,FSankaranarayanan says the programme is
OL,9,Fa win for both patients and the health
OL,10,Fservice.
OL,12,FHe said: "It's saving the NHS money by
OL,13,Fbringing everything together in a one-
OL,14,Fstop shop, and by averting
OL,15,Fhospitalisation.
OL,26,@tD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
