PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1786744260
OL,3,CLife-saving heart screenings from
OL,4,Cfootball club 'win for patients and
OL,5,CNHS'
OL,7,F"When people with this condition are
OL,8,Fhospitalised, it's usually for about
OL,9,Ften days, costing up to five thousand
OL,10,Fpounds and by preventing hospital
OL,11,Fstays, we're saving the NHS a lot of
OL,12,Fmoney."
OL,14,FThe programme is delivered from
OL,15,FEverton in the Community's purpose-
OL,16,Fbuilt mental health and wellbeing hub,
OL,17,Fa Premier League first.
OL,26,@tD@GO]
