OL,3,CLife-saving heart screenings from
OL,4,Cfootball club 'win for patients and
OL,5,CNHS'
OL,7,FThe screenings are part of a wider
OL,8,Fpush to move healthcare out of
OL,9,Fhospitals and into the heart of
OL,10,Fcommunities.
OL,12,FFor Ray, the test has meant everything.
OL,14,FNow, he's making plans for the future
OL,15,Fand looking forward to another season
OL,16,Fwatching his beloved Blues.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
